{"confident":true,"explanation":"The integrand is nonnegative and even, so A = 2∫₀^∞ x/(x⁴+9) dx. Substituting u=x² gives A = ∫₀^∞ 1/(u²+9) du = (1/3)[arctan(u/3)]₀^∞ = π/6.","answers":[{"key":"field-1","correct_option":null,"correct_value":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}","value_type":"math","wrong_value":"\\frac{\\pi}{3}","correct_keys":[{"text":"\\pi","key":null},{"text":"/6","key":null},{"text":null,"key":"ArrowRight"}],"wrong_keys":[{"text":"\\pi","key":null},{"text":"/3","key":null},{"text":null,"key":"ArrowRight"}]}]}